+/* Porthole 0069 (diagnostic): the LIVE guest registers of a running thread. The FEX frame at x28+0x20 is only written back when the JIT code
+ * returns to its dispatcher, so a loop made of indirect jumps never updates it (0052 showed the same registers every sample while the
+ * host registers, mapped as in 0051, kept changing). Host register -> x86: rax x8, rcx x0, rdx x1, rbx x27, rsp x23, rbp fp, rsi x25,
